    "description": "Seize this rare chance to own 2 exquisite vacant units in a highly sought-after neighborhood. Each unit boasts an abundance of natural light, featuring expansive living and dining areas complemented by charming fireplaces. The spacious layouts include two generously sized bedrooms, all adorned w/stunning hardwood floors. Both units have been updated and are move-in ready perfect for personal use or as investment opportunities. The upper unit offers views of Sutro Tower, creating a serene oasis in the heart of the city. Double pane windows ensure a peaceful ambiance. Both units have washer and dryer while the property includes 2 tandem parking spaces and ample storage. Lush landscaped backyard features a charming paved patio surrounded by greenery. Located minutes from downtown Noe Valley, the Castro, and the Mission District, this prime location places you close to Dolores Park, vibrant restaurants, and trendy cafes. With easy access to CPMC Mission/Bernal Campus, Highway 101, and public transportation, this property epitomizes urban living at its finest.  Don't miss this exceptional opportunity to invest in a dynamic and desirable part of SF."
  },
